ample run:\r\n\r\n```shellsession\r\n$ make veryclean\r\nrm -rf \\\r\nalembic/__pycache__ \\\r\nalembic/versions/__pycache__ \\\r\ntests/__pycache__\r\nrm -rf deps\r\n$ make setup\r\nmkdir deps\r\npoetry install\r\nCreating virtualenv alembic-issue-25-XD3-Gl9B-py3.7 in deps/virtualenvs\r\nInstalling dependencies from lock file\r\n\r\n\r\nPackage operations: 18 installs, 0 updates, 0 removals\r\n\r\n  - Installing zipp (3.1.0)\r\n  - Installing importlib-metadata (1.6.0)\r\n  - Installing markupsafe (1.1.1)\r\n  - Installing pyparsing (2.4.7)\r\n  - Installing six (1.15.0)\r\n  - Installing attrs (19.3.0)\r\n  - Installing mako (1.1.2)\r\n  - Installing more-itertools (8.3.0)\r\n  - Installing packaging (20.4)\r\n  - Installing pluggy (0.13.1)\r\n  - Installing py (1.8.1)\r\n  - Installing python-dateutil (2.8.1)\r\n  - Installing python-editor (1.0.4)\r\n  - Installing sqlalchemy (1.3.17)\r\n  - Installing wcwidth (0.1.9)\r\n  - Installing alembic (1.4.2)\r\n  - Installing psycopg2 (2.8.5)\r\n  - Installing pytest (5.4.2)\r\n$ poetry run make test\r\nPGURI=postgresql://postgres:example@localhost/issue_25_$$ pytest -v -s tests/issue-25.py\r\n=========================================== test session starts ===========================================\r\nplatform linux -- Python 3.7.6, pytest-5.4.2, py-1.8.1, pluggy-0.13.1 -- /local_scratch/george.hartzell/tmp/alembic-issue-25/deps/virtualenvs/alembic-issue-25-XD3-Gl9B-py3.7/bin/python\r\ncachedir: .pytest_cache\r\nrootdir: /local_scratch/george.hartzell/tmp/alembic-issue-25, inifile: setup.cfg\r\ncollected 1 item\r\n\r\ntests/issue-25.py::test_success INFO  [alembic.runtime.migration] Context impl PostgresqlImpl.\r\nINFO  [alembic.runtime.migration] Will assume transactional DDL.\r\nINFO  [alembic.runtime.migration] Running upgrade  -> 98c5a08793e3, create work_queue tables\r\nPASSEDINFO  [alembic.runtime.migration] Context impl PostgresqlImpl.\r\nINFO  [alembic.runtime.migration] Will assume transactional DDL.\r\nINFO 